<title>The Philippines: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/philippines/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-philippines-2026-11-22T08:19:02.412Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sun, 22 Nov 2026 08:19:02 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;The Philippine Coast Guard is intensifying maritime security, seeking drones and cybersecurity assistance from Australia and signing a maritime cooperation pact with Finland while boosting its presence in Talisay and tightening checks on mineral shipments to Cebu. Rescue operations saved 22 people from a distressed boat off Palawan and are searching for a woman swept away at a waterfall in Ipoh. President Ferdinand R. Marcos Jr. expressed optimism for improved relations with China after speaking with Chinese Foreign Minister Wang Yi in Shenzhen. The UCDP reported 176 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiigFBVV95cUxPTVpNQ0wtMVAyamlvNmlHUGxuY29vTXlhX085QW5yOWY0WjU2dVM2cFYxdU9CcjVtTHVuVXRSSDlod2xPV2V3T2lESU90VDZ2eE9ldV9JblI3bHZHMVg5TXd6YjhOZC1iclZZU0RfQ2NYWUN2cWw1UlZfVXdyYVhDdU9WbGcyazFtN2c?oc=5&quot;&gt;Daily Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiWEFVX3lxTE9lOHA4bVBxcFZSWXBTMndjaDdNaDl0eGtPYUt2UkpfN0lsWlZNSUJ4T05fVW9LNkd2SUR6UWhZUmx5akJiVndNaFY2TjJEUF9ka1dsSExESjk?oc=5&quot;&gt;Taiwan News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwwFBVV95cUxOd3k1S0NTa184aVpCTUZpYU5xbVBnZ0NyZHdFWUVha0pxajFFSlRINXE4a2tLRnhNcTZ3eHJnaTVQc2ZKdFk0dHNCQ1VKRGVGYk9KN3BNckJ0RUpwUjBWd0V4TGg0MHhYRVExTF9scmR6c3g4c19YdDJEUXlnMVp3aGhGQTZ3SWI5YVlwcGx1azZBV2xoeTQxTzFaMkVOeHRMM1lVTGtjOG5xTEo2VUFYQ3BCYmJRNHI5UW4yemtyNnVzSVk?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Mindanao Sentinel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Inquirer.net&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Philstar.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipwFBVV95cUxQU3hfcTQ3UG9kaE9NZTdEN2JyazhldkJGaWRzYzk2cG03bnBXaThack5aTWxXRzA3UVpuN084dEN2aUxpYzNFUzhTNTBCNmZzWHhJYmJOOHc0QVdpbXhYcU1KN